//
// The decode (aie2_decode.py) at the model's 16 layers compiles, with no NPU
// and no weights: its pinned memtiles (aie2_decode.MemtilePins) are fullest,
// and its placement differs, at the layer count only the nightly runs.
//
// REQUIRES: peano
//
// RUN: %python %S/aie2_decode.py --n-layers 16 --full-elf-path %t.elf
